    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d199">

                <pb facs="0254" n="162" sameAs="frus:frus1943CairoTehran/pg162"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Stettinius</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        President</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-11-08">November 8, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum for the
                    President</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Subject: Oil concessions in the Middle East.</p>
                <p>As I promised at our meeting Friday,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d199-f1"/> I am pleased
                    to enclose herewith a two-page memorandum summarizing the problem of oil
                    concessions in the Middle East. This is the memorandum you said you wanted to
                    have with you.</p>
                <closer><signed>E. R. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stettinius,
                    Jr.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d199-a1.xml" xpointer="d199-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
